name: Actual Map and scan completions keep unsent drafts, paste blocks and printable keys
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY OPENROUTER_API_KEY GEMINI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/completion_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | setup
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 15 Commit this Map plan | start-map
keys: Enter
paste-file: @ART/multiline.txt
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/completion_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART map-draft
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT READY | map-draft
expect: paste #1
type: ud
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | map-edited
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/completion_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft map-edited ud
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/completion_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART map-edited
keys: Left Left C-y
require-live-snap: 20 first owned α | paste-inspection
expect: second owned β
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | inspection-return
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | cursor-end
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | draft-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | draft-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | draft-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | draft-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | draft-40x12
ask: Does the completed Map remain an explicit decision while the collapsed paste and ud keystrokes stay in the composer, with readable input controls at all six sizes?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 describe what to map | draft-cleared
keys: C-_
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | map-restored
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/completion_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft map-restored ud
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/completion_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART map-restored
keys: Escape
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/completion_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART map-selected
paste-file: @ART/scan-command.txt
keys: Enter
paste-file: @ART/scan-draft.txt
require-live-snap: 30 Finish or clear the command draft | held-prerequisite
type: r
require-live-snap: 20 operator α r | prerequisite-typed
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/completion_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft prerequisite-typed "operator α r"
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/completion_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prereq-draft
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 r reuse cached | prerequisite-cleared
keys: r
paste-file: @ART/scan-draft.txt
require-live-snap: 30 operator α | scan-new-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/completion_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART scan-draft
require-live-snap: 30 ○ idle | scan-settled
keys: Left
type: X
require-live-snap: 20 operator αX | scan-typed
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/completion_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft scan-typed "operator αX"
ask: After the actual manifest scan completes, does X edit the draft at its retained cursor without selecting a result, submitting work or starting another job?
keys: Escape
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 30 owned-example | restarted-source
expect: signal-only
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/completion_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain the actual Map selection and single policy observation without another model request or automatic scan?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
